From: DshanControl maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] qrandom: declare the seed sequence result type

GCC 9's libstdc++ validates SeedSequence::result_type while selecting the
mersenne_twister_engine constructor. Qt 5.11.3's internal SystemGenerator
already generates quint32 values but does not declare the required alias.
Add that alias without changing the entropy source or generated data.

Local compatibility patch for the Tina Buildroot 201902 host qmake build.

--- a/src/corelib/global/qrandom.cpp
+++ b/src/corelib/global/qrandom.cpp
@@ -133,6 +133,7 @@
 
 struct QRandomGenerator::SystemGenerator
 {
+    typedef quint32 result_type;
 #if QT_CONFIG(getentropy)
     static qsizetype fillBuffer(void *buffer, qsizetype count) Q_DECL_NOTHROW
     {
